  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="5aaa86cf-e633-519a-8d55-e03409905d17" activityNameId="9f85244d-b6d1-5d1f-810e-25f4bd7d4ea0" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Wood pellet manufacturing, infrastructure</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Wood pellet manufacturing, infrastructure
The capacity of the pellet extruder (output = 1250 kg/h) fits the need better than edge mills which would have higher output per machine weight. The life time of the infrastructure is assumed as 50 years (machines are replaced once in this time). The life time output is 1E8 m3 pellets. This data must only be used to consider the infrastructure needed for pelletising wood if this is not relevant.;
Synonyms: Pelletierpresse, Kolbenstrangpresse, extruder; 
UUID: b0b2bbd8-a529-32b9-948b-075b6eec4227
The material (production and disposal) and their transports needed for a wood pellet manufacturing machine in a sawmill. Land used is only included for the hall in which the process is run and the pellets are stored as the rest is already included in the sawmill.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Pellet extruder
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: estimation 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_b0b2bbd8-a529-32b9-948b-075b6eec4227.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
